<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW213822209 BCX0" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; overflow: visible; cursor: text; clear: both; position: relative; direction: ltr; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><p class="Paragraph SCXW213822209 BCX0" paraid="1656599464" paraeid="{f744cfb6-72e9-42e9-855d-fb59fad2723d}{171}" style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: baseline; font-kerning: none; background-color: transparent;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2">Hello {!Contact.FirstName} ,&nbsp;&nbsp;</font></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW213822209 BCX0" paraid="1656599464" paraeid="{f744cfb6-72e9-42e9-855d-fb59fad2723d}{171}" style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: baseline; font-kerning: none; background-color: transparent;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2"><br></font></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW213822209 BCX0" paraid="1656599464" paraeid="{f744cfb6-72e9-42e9-855d-fb59fad2723d}{171}" style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: baseline; font-kerning: none; background-color: transparent;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2">&nbsp;</font></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW213822209 BCX0" paraid="1656599464" paraeid="{f744cfb6-72e9-42e9-855d-fb59fad2723d}{171}" style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: baseline; font-kerning: none; background-color: transparent;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2">Thank you for letting me know that you are looking to have International Employees utilize the Insperity Premier Time and Attendance system. At this point, I have sent a request to our Data Privacy team to confirm that we can grant your International Employees access to the system. I will get back to you shortly with the next steps that your International Employees might need to complete.  &nbsp;</font></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW213822209 BCX0" paraid="1656599464" paraeid="{f744cfb6-72e9-42e9-855d-fb59fad2723d}{171}" style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: baseline; font-kerning: none; background-color: transparent;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2"><br></font></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW213822209 BCX0" paraid="1656599464" paraeid="{f744cfb6-72e9-42e9-855d-fb59fad2723d}{171}" style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: baseline; font-kerning: none; background-color: transparent;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2">Please let me know if you have any questions or concerns.  &nbsp;</font></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW213822209 BCX0" paraid="1656599464" paraeid="{f744cfb6-72e9-42e9-855d-fb59fad2723d}{171}" style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: baseline; font-kerning: none; background-color: transparent;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2"><br></font></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW213822209 BCX0" paraid="1656599464" paraeid="{f744cfb6-72e9-42e9-855d-fb59fad2723d}{171}" style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: baseline; font-kerning: none; background-color: transparent;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2">Thank you,&nbsp;</font></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW213822209 BCX0" paraid="1656599464" paraeid="{f744cfb6-72e9-42e9-855d-fb59fad2723d}{171}" style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: baseline; font-kerning: none; background-color: transparent;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2"><br></font></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW213822209 BCX0" paraid="1656599464" paraeid="{f744cfb6-72e9-42e9-855d-fb59fad2723d}{171}" style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: baseline; font-kerning: none; background-color: transparent;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2"><br></font></p></div>]]></td>
